      <description><![CDATA[
        <h3>What's new in 1.1.1</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Certificate: a cleaner in-app "Install &amp; Trust" guide for the macOS CA, with a one-click install and a manual fallback.</li>
          <li>Fixed the certificate trust status sometimes showing "not trusted" right after a successful install.</li>
          <li>System proxy no longer shows an admin password prompt every time you toggle it on/off.</li>
          <li>Stability fixes around certificate installation.</li>
        </ul>
      ]]></description>
